<style is:inline>
.pagehero{position:relative;isolation:isolate;overflow:hidden;min-height:58vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;color:#fff}
.pagehero .bgimg{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;z-index:0}
.pagehero .veil{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:1;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(42,35,29,.6),rgba(42,35,29,.45) 45%,rgba(42,35,29,.9))}
.pagehero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:2;width:100%;padding-top:130px;padding-bottom:64px}
.pagehero .eyebrow{color:var(--acc-soft)}
.pagehero h1{font-size:clamp(42px,5vw,72px);max-width:16ch;color:#fff;text-shadow:0 2px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.45)}
.pagehero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--acc-soft)}
.pagehero .lede{color:rgba(255,255,255,.88);margin:20px 0 0;max-width:54ch;text-shadow:0 2px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.45)}
.pagehero .btn-line{color:#fff;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.6)}.pagehero .btn-line:hover{background:#fff;color:var(--dark)}
.areas{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px}
.area{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-top:4px solid var(--acc);border-radius:8px;padding:30px 26px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.area h3{margin-bottom:10px}.area p{color:var(--muted);font-size:16px;margin:0 0 14px;flex:1}
.area ul{margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;display:grid;gap:6px}
.area li{position:relative;padding-left:22px;font-size:15px}.area li:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:.6em;width:12px;height:2px;background:var(--acc)}
.pkg ul{list-style:none;margin:0 0 16px;padding:0;display:grid;gap:8px}
.pkg li{position:relative;padding-left:24px;font-size:15.5px;color:var(--muted)}.pkg li:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:.6em;width:12px;height:2px;background:var(--acc)}
.offer.feat.pkg li{color:rgba(255,255,255,.85)}.offer.feat.pkg li:before{background:var(--acc-soft)}
.about-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.8fr) minmax(0,1.2fr);gap:56px;align-items:start}
.about-grid img{width:100%;max-width:420px;aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 15%;border-radius:10px}
.about-grid .prose p{font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;margin:0 0 18px}
.facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px;margin-top:32px}
.facts div{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:22px}
.facts b{display:block;font-family:var(--disp);font-size:34px;line-height:1;color:var(--acc-ink);margin-bottom:6px}
.facts span{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}
.start-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:56px;align-items:start}
.formcard{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-top:5px solid var(--acc);border-radius:10px;padding:30px 26px;min-height:420px}
.formcard h3{margin-bottom:6px}.formcard p{color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;margin:0 0 16px}
.hs-form-frame{min-height:300px}
.legal-prose{max-width:760px}.legal-prose p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 16px}.legal-prose h3{margin:30px 0 10px}
@media(max-width:900px){.areas{grid-template-columns:1fr}.about-grid,.start-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:32px}.about-grid img{max-width:360px}.facts{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
@media(max-width:760px){.pagehero{min-height:50vh}.pagehero .wrap{padding-top:104px}}
</style>
</head>
<body data-time="future" class="inner">
  <header class="site"><div class="wrap bar">
    <a class="brand" href="/">Tercet <b>Law</b></a>
    <nav class="navlinks" id="navlinks"><a href="/services">Practice areas</a><a href="/process">How it works</a><a href="/pricing">Fees</a><a href="/about">About</a><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Book a call</a></nav><button class="navtoggle" type="button" aria-label="Open menu" aria-controls="navlinks" aria-expanded="false"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
  </div></header>

  <main>
    <section class="pagehero"><img class="bgimg" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1505664194779-8beaceb93744?w=1800&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A law library" fetchpriority="high" /><div class="veil"></div><div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Practice areas</p><h1>Estate planning, trusts, probate, <em>elder law and succession.</em></h1><p class="lede">Six areas, one attorney, one flat fee. Every engagement begins with a confidential planning call.</p><div class="ctarow" style="margin-top:28px"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Book a planning call</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="tel:+18888332510">(888) 833-2510</a></div>
    </div></section>
    <section class="sec" id="areas"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">What we do</p><h2>Six areas. One firm.</h2><p class="lede">We do not take every kind of case. We do this work, carefully, for individuals, couples, parents and business owners.</p></div>
      <div class="areas"><div class="area"><h3>Wills and directives</h3><p>The documents every adult needs, drafted to fit and signed properly.</p><ul><li>Last will and testament</li><li>Health care directive and living will</li><li>Financial and medical powers of attorney</li><li>Guardian nominations for minor children</li></ul></div><div class="area"><h3>Trusts</h3><p>A revocable living trust, funded, so your estate stays private and out of probate.</p><ul><li>Revocable living trust</li><li>Deed and account retitling (funding)</li><li>Pour-over will</li><li>Trusts for a child, a parent, or a person with special needs</li></ul></div><div class="area"><h3>Probate and estate administration</h3><p>When someone has died, steady guidance through the court and the paperwork.</p><ul><li>Opening and closing the estate</li><li>Executor and personal representative counsel</li><li>Creditor notices and distributions</li><li>Small-estate and independent administration where available</li></ul></div><div class="area"><h3>Elder law</h3><p>Planning for a parent, or for yourself, before a crisis makes the decisions for you.</p><ul><li>Powers of attorney that actually work at the bank and the hospital</li><li>Long-term care and incapacity planning</li><li>Guardianship and conservatorship, when nothing else will do</li><li>Family meetings, with everyone in the room</li></ul></div><div class="area"><h3>Business succession</h3><p>Who runs the company if you cannot, and how it passes without a fight.</p><ul><li>Buy-sell agreements</li><li>Operating agreement and bylaw review</li><li>Ownership transfer to family or a key employee</li><li>Coordination with your CPA and financial advisor</li></ul></div><div class="area"><h3>Plan reviews and updates</h3><p>A plan is only good if it is current. We review existing documents and bring them up to date.</p><ul><li>Review of documents drafted elsewhere</li><li>Updates after a marriage, birth, death, move or sale</li><li>Beneficiary designation audit</li><li>Annual check-in for ongoing clients</li></ul></div></div>
    </div></section>
    <section class="split alt" id="how"><div class="split__media" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1450101499163-c8848c66ca85?w=1400&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop')" role="img" aria-label="Signing a document with a fountain pen"></div><div class="split__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">How an engagement runs</p><h2>Quoted first. Explained throughout. Signed properly.</h2>
      <ul class="ticks"><li>A flat fee in writing before any work begins.</li><li>Drafts you can read, with every clause explained in plain English.</li><li>A signing meeting with witnesses and a notary arranged.</li><li>Your documents delivered, and the trust funded.</li></ul>
      <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="/process/">See the process</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="/pricing/">See fees</a></div>
    </div></section>
    <section class="sec" id="faq"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2>Straight answers.</h2></div>
      <div class="faq"><details><summary>Do you handle divorce or custody?</summary><p>No. Tercet Law is an estate planning, probate and elder law firm. We are glad to refer you to a family law attorney.</p></details><details><summary>Can you review a plan another attorney drafted?</summary><p>Yes. A plan review is a flat fee, and we tell you honestly whether it needs changes.</p></details><details><summary>Do I have to come to an office?</summary><p>No. Planning meetings are virtual. Signings are arranged where it is convenient for you, with witnesses and a notary.</p></details><details><summary>Where are you licensed?</summary><p>Alabama, with Texas admission pending. Based in Austin.</p></details></div>
    </div></section>
    <section class="sec final" id="begin"><img class="bgimg" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1524758631624-e2822e304c36?w=1800&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A bright, quiet office" loading="lazy" /><div class="veil"></div><div class="wrap">
      <h2>Book a confidential planning call.</h2><p class="lede">Thirty minutes. You leave knowing what you need and exactly what it costs.</p>
      <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Book a planning call</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="tel:+18888332510">(888) 833-2510</a></div>
    </div></section>
  </main>

